    LLM: "Always play with a pair or better. Fold with poor hands. The AA bonus is a side bet with high house edge - play only for entertainment.\n\nOptimal strategy is complex but generally: Play with any pair, any ace high, any king high with good kickers, and many queen-high hands. Fold weak hands that don't connect with the flop.\n\nFully optimal strategy involves considering all possible outcomes. Rough guideline: Call with about 60% of hands. The house edge is approximately 2.16% with optimal play. The AA bonus bet has much higher house edge (around 6-7%).",
